{"doc":"## Energy, $E = mc^2$\n\nThe roots are $x = \\frac{-b \\pm \\sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}$, where $a \\neq 0$, and it costs $5 or $6.\n\n$$\n\\int_0^\\infty e^{-x^2}\\,dx = \\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2}\n$$\n\n> A quote with $\\alpha + \\beta$ in it.\n\n$$\\sum_{i=1}^{n} i = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$$\n\n- An item with $a_1 + a_2$ in it\n- [ ] A box with $\\sqrt{2}$\n\nOne that cannot be read: $\\frac{a$ here.\n\n$$\n\\frac{a\n$$\n\nAfter a block the words go on, with $e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0$ near the end of a long line that wraps round to the next.\n","theme":"light","codeLight":"pastel","codeDark":"pastel","display":"mixed","readOnly":false,"textSize":"large","noteFace":"maple","caret":null,"anchor":null,"mermaid":null,"width":704,"window":{"width":704,"height":2600},"content":{"left":0,"top":0,"right":704,"bottom":996.672},"editor":{"left":0,"top":0,"right":704,"bottom":996.672},"gutter":"calc(clamp(1.25rem, 1.1678rem + 0.4112vw, 1.5625rem) * 1.1)","colours":{"--glacier-bg":[253,253,253,255],"--glacier-text":[13,13,13,255],"--glacier-text-muted":[61,61,61,255],"--glacier-text-subtle":[116,116,116,255],"--glacier-accent-text":[13,13,13,255],"--app-ink-2":[61,61,61,255],"--app-ink-3":[116,116,116,255],"--code-bg":[234,234,234,255],"--code-fg":[13,13,13,255],"--code-keyword":[145,74,140,255],"--code-string":[38,123,76,255],"--code-comment":[121,129,141,255],"--code-type":[157,99,0,255],"--code-property":[163,73,69,255],"--code-name":[34,102,164,255],"--code-literal":[174,85,40,255],"--code-punctuation":[61,61,61,255],"--code-macro":[0,121,128,255],"--code-meta":[104,87,150,255]},"lines":[{"from":0,"to":21,"text":"## Energy, $E = mc^2$","classes":["lineH2"],"rect":{"left":0,"top":23.734,"right":704,"bottom":62.328},"ground":{"color":[0,0,0,0],"bar":null,"borders":[0,0,0,0],"padding":[0,23.7376,0,23.7376],"margins":[0,0],"corners":[[0],[0],[0],[0]]},"color":[13,13,13,255],"size":18.2177,"weight":"400","style":"normal","family":"Maple Mono","decoration":"none","decorationStyle":"solid",